{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The writing of Hezekiah. And he lived.</b> Like עד חיותם (Joshua 5:8), meaning continued existence; and so אתה מחיה את כולם (Nehemiah 9:6), likewise the boundary of life:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {0 "The verse citation given as Joshua 5:8 does not contain the phrase עד חיותם in the standard Hebrew text; resolved the citation as printed."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:50.609279880Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}